{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a captivating journey in Fuse - an immersive adventure that blends action, stealth, and puzzle-solving in a unique gameplay experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamlessly shift between two distinct characters, each offering their own specialized abilities. Master the art of stealth by using paper planes to distract enemies, or fly your way past the shadowed depths of the mountains. Merge their abilities to form a swift and powerful melee combatant, ready to face any foe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, you'll confront enemies, overcome environmental obstacles, and solve puzzles to uncover fragments of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environment.</strong> A world made of paper, wool, and creativity \u2014 cut, glued, and brought to life by hand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles.</strong> Use each character\u2019s unique strengths to overcome challenges together.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story.</strong> Experience a narrative beyond words \u2014 immersive, emotional, and open to interpretation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033000/extras/9efecd5c311989d4c9b4759dd979f5d2.avif?t=1773919731\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033000/extras_big/9efecd5c311989d4c9b4759dd979f5d2.webp?t=1773919731 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Blue Bug","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4033000/45b28dacacda26b99b72ca2c705f7bd70694351f.jpg"},{"name":"The Pink Crane","path":"https://cdn.akamai